WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Open the Loftwah Creative Archive on the released album cover.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.750
Compare the square cover with the tall release poster.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.050
Press Command+F and find Fighter’s Before the Bell artwork.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.850
Add it to Favourites.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.000
Switch to Afterlight, a separate set of offline studies.
